HEADS AAAAA

START ***** INIT1 ***** SSSSS

// First, replace all of the = with ~ to fill in the water
INIT1 ##### INIT1 ##### RRRRR
INIT1 ===== INIT1 ~~~~~ RRRRR
INIT1 _____ INIT2 ***** LLLLL
INIT2 !!!!! INIT2 ***** LLLLL
INIT2 _____ INIT3 ***** RRRRR
INIT3 ***** PASS1 ***** LSRDS

// Next, make the first pass filling in water
PASS1 *#*** PASS1 ***** RRRRR
PASS1 #~*** PASS1 ***** RRRRR
PASS1 ~~~** PASS1 ***~~ RRRRR
PASS1 ~~#** PASS1 ***** RRRRR
PASS1 *_*** LEFT1 ***** LLLLL

// Next, go back to the beginning
LEFT1 *!*** LEFT1 ***** LLLLL
LEFT1 *_*** LEFT2 ***** RRRRR
LEFT2 ***** PASS2 ***** DDDDS

// Finally, make another pass filling in the next layer of water
PASS2 *_**! PASS2 ***** RRRRR
PASS2 _~~*! PASS2 ***** RRRRR
PASS2 ~~_*! PASS2 ***** RRRRR
PASS2 _~_*! PASS2 ***** RRRRR
PASS2 ~~~*! PASS2 ***~* RRRRR
PASS2 ****_ STOP  ***** SSSSS
